# Contact form (Formspree) — server-only, never expose as NEXT_PUBLIC_*
# 1. Create a form at https://formspree.io
# 2. Copy the form id from the endpoint https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx
# 3. Paste below (no quotes needed in most setups)
FORMSPREE_FORM_ID=

